        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-F3-MDB, Tai Chi Bamboo Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tai Chi Towel Bar is great for beach homes and also those with an Asian motif. The bamboo along the mounts' edge grant this towel bar and exotic look. It is available in 3 sizes: 18 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch, all of which are finished in medium bronze. It is easy to install and comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/bamboo-tai-chi-towel-ring-fusion-tr-f3-mdb\"><b>Fusion TR-F3 Tai Chi Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/tai-chi-toiler-paper-holder-fusion-ph-f3-mdb\"><b>Fusion PH-F3 Tai Chi Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/tai-chi-trim-robe-hook-fusion-rh-f3\"><b>Fusion RH-F3 Tai Chi Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-F3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-F3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-F3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The Tai Chi Towel Bar is only available in Medium Bronze Finish. Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
